ods.\nY con una comunidad, básicamente igual a la de TF2 y con eso ya te digo todo.\nGimme an R, gimme an S, gimme a Rock and Stone.\n\nBastante divertidas las actualizaciones pues.", "timestamp_created": 1663503413, "timestamp_updated": 1733169186, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "122349846", "author": {"steamid": "76561198263392788", "personaname": "M o o ᴎ K ʏ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Moonky_Bj/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 15501, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7622, "last_played": 1703997693, "avatar": "150d198fb20cd1e0f32b14fcf10b5eaa74ae3fc9"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Ta re piolón", "timestamp_created": 1663377094, "timestamp_updated": 1663377094, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "122335148", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035707566", "personaname": "Dominator", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Domiiiiii/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 14968, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10778, "last_played": 1691293102, "avatar": "9cfd66c70e57e254e77dacd3a5a5031254de6d96"}, "language": "latam", "review": "If you \"rock and stone\",you are never alone.", "timestamp_created": 1663352991, "timestamp_updated": 1663352991, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comme